cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Sheaf-MPNN: A Library for Sheaf Neural Networks as Message Passing"
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch Geometric library that reformulates sheaf diffusion as local
  incidence-wise transport and aggregation, with fifteen families of Sheaf
  Neural Networks under a unified message-passing framework and a unified
  benchmarking suite.
